' SD-05. UC-005 전진 중 장애물 감지 후 후진 전환
' Related Use Case: UC-005. 전진 중 장애물 감지 후 후진 전환
' Intent: 전진 중 먼지가 없고 전방 장애물이 감지될 때 일반 모드로 시계 방향 90도 회전을 시작하고 후방이 열리면 후진으로 전환하는 흐름을 표현한다.

@startuml SD_05_UC005_Forward_Obstacle_To_Backward
hide footbox
title SD-05 - UC-005 전진 중 장애물 감지 후 후진 전환

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "RotationContext" as RotationContext
participant "CommandResult" as CommandResult
participant "CleaningCommand" as CleaningCommand
participant "MovementCommand" as MovementCommand
actor "청소 장치" as Cleaner
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

Sensor -> Controller: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected=false, currentDirection=FORWARD, frontObstacleDetected=true)
activate Controller
Controller -> SensorState: updateSensorSnapshot(frontObstacleDetected=true, backObstacleDetected, dustDetected=false)
Controller -> Cleaning: handleSensorState(SensorState)
activate Cleaning
Cleaning -> SensorState: currentDirection()
SensorState --> Cleaning: FORWARD
Cleaning -> RotationContext: start(cause=OBSTACLE, rotation=CLOCKWISE, targetSensor=BACK, nextDirection=BACKWARD)
RotationContext --> Cleaning: activeContext
Cleaning -> CleaningCommand: create(NORMAL)
Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(TURN_CLOCKWISE_90)
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withCleaning(normalCommand)
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withMovement(turnCommand)
Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult
deactivate Cleaning

Controller -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(NORMAL)
Controller -> Drive: turnClockwise90()

Sensor -> Controller: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected=false)
Controller -> SensorState: updateBackObstacle(false)
Controller -> Cleaning: handleSensorState(SensorState)
activate Cleaning
Cleaning -> SensorState: obstacleDetectedIn(BACKWARD)
SensorState --> Cleaning: false
Cleaning -> RotationContext: complete()
Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_BACKWARD)
Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(moveBackwardCommand)
deactivate Cleaning

Controller -> Drive: moveBackward()
deactivate Controller
@enduml
